links and facilitator that were already editable.

The date conversion lives in @workspace/domain with tests, because the
obvious one-liner is wrong outside UTC: it would have shown a 6pm Lagos
class as 5pm and, on an untouched save, actually moved it. A test also
caught an empty minutes box turning a class into five minutes.

